<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Bundieful Podcast — Real Talk. Real Faith. Real Impact.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bundieful Podcast — real conversations about identity, faith, purpose and the issues shaping young people.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
 --black:#050505;--black2:#0b0b0b;--gold:#d8a62d;--gold2:#f4c85b;
 --cream:#f5f1e7;--muted:#aaa69d;--line:rgba(216,166,45,.22);--max:1180px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--black);color:var(--cream);font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{width:min(92%,var(--max));margin:auto}
.nav{height:78px;position:fixed;z-index:50;left:0;right:0;top:0;background:rgba(5,5,5,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.navin{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-family:Manrope;font-weight:800;font-size:1.08rem}.brand img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--gold)}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:28px;color:#d9d3c7;font-weight:600;font-size:.94rem}.navlinks a:hover{color:var(--gold2)}
.menu{display:none;background:none;color:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:1.1rem}

.hero{min-height:880px;padding:150px 0 90px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:700px;height:700px;right:-260px;top:80px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(216,166,45,.18),transparent 67%)}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,5,5,.98) 0%,rgba(5,5,5,.83) 43%,rgba(5,5,5,.28) 100%);pointer-events:none}
.heroGrid{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:.72rem}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:Manrope;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.055em}h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7.2vw,7rem);margin:18px 0}
h1 .gold{color:var(--gold2)}.heroLead{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:620px;margin:0 0 30px}
.buttons{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:800;transition:.2s}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.primary{background:var(--gold);color:#0a0803;border-color:var(--gold)}.ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.035)}
.heroLogo{display:flex;justify-content:center;position:relative}.heroLogo img{width:min(520px,100%);border-radius:50%;display:block;box-shadow:0 25px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.7);border:1px solid rgba(216,166,45,.45)}
.orbit{position:absolute;inset:-25px;border:1px solid rgba(216,166,45,.22);border-radius:50%;animation:spin 24s linear infinite;pointer-events:none}.orbit:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold2);top:10%;right:19%;box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--gold2)}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}

.strip{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b0b0b}.stripin{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:center}.stripitem{padding:24px 12px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.stripitem:last-child{border:0}.stripitem b{font-family:Manrope;color:var(--gold2);display:block}.stripitem span{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted)}

section{padding:105px 0}.dark{background:#090909;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.sectionHead{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;margin-bottom:35px}.sectionHead h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.7vw,4.5rem);margin:10px 0 0}.sectionHead p{color:var(--muted);max-width:500px}
.feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:22px}.featureMain,.featureSide{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;background:#111}.featureMain{padding:35px;min-height:430px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:end;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,rgba(216,166,45,.2),transparent 30%),linear-gradient(145deg,#211a0c,#0d0d0d)}
.num{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.16em;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase}.featureMain h3{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem);margin:14px 0}.featureMain p,.mini p{color:var(--muted)}.mini{padding:27px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mini:last-child{border:0}.mini h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin:8px 0}

.manifesto{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.bigquote{font-family:Manrope;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5.1rem);letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:.98}.bigquote span{color:var(--gold2)}.copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 18px}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:28px}.value{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px;background:#0e0e0e}.value b{color:var(--gold2);display:block}.value span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}

.connectGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.social{padding:25px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:#0f0f0f}.social strong{font-family:Manrope;font-size:1.25rem}.social p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin:5px 0 14px}.social a{color:var(--gold2);font-weight:800}
.cta{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b1407,#090909)}.ctaBox{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;padding:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4.8rem);margin:10px 0 0}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 0;color:#858077}.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}

.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:.7s ease}.show{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media(max-width:850px){
 .navlinks{display:none}.menu{display:block}.hero{min-height:auto}.heroGrid,.feature,.manifesto{grid-template-columns:1fr}.heroLogo{order:-1;max-width:430px;margin:auto}.orbit{inset:-15px}
 .stripin,.values,.connectGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stripitem{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.stripitem:last-child{border-bottom:0}
 .sectionHead,.ctaBox,.foot{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.hero{padding-top:125px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav"><div class="wrap navin">
<a class="brand" href="#top"><img src="bundieful-logo.jpg" alt="Bundieful Podcast logo"><span>Bundieful Podcast</span></a>
<nav class="navlinks"><a href="#episodes">Episodes</a><a href="#story">Our story</a><a href="#connect">Connect</a></nav>
<button class="menu" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
</div></header>

<main id="top">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap heroGrid">
<div class="reveal">
<div class="eyebrow">Faith • Purpose • Impact</div>
<h1>Real talk.<br>Real <span class="gold">faith.</span><br>Real impact.</h1>
<p class="heroLead">A podcast for a generation asking real questions about identity, faith, purpose, relationships and the pressures shaping our lives.</p>
<div class="buttons"><a class="btn primary" href="#episodes">▶ Start listening</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#story">Why Bundieful?</a></div>
</div>
<div class="heroLogo reveal"><div class="orbit"></div><img src="bundieful-logo.jpg" alt="Bundieful Podcast official logo"></div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="strip"><div class="wrap stripin">
<div class="stripitem"><b>IDENTITY</b><span>Who am I?</span></div>
<div class="stripitem"><b>FAITH</b><span>What do I believe?</span></div>
<div class="stripitem"><b>IMPACT</b><span>What will I do with my story?</span></div>
</div></div>

<section class="dark" id="episodes"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sectionHead reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">The first conversations</div><h2>Start here.</h2></div><p>Two powerful conversations open the Bundieful journey: discovering identity and confronting the reality of drug abuse.</p></div>
<div class="feature">
<article class="featureMain reveal"><div class="num">Episode 01 / Identity</div><h3>Who Am I?</h3><p>Identity, belonging, labels and the deeper question: who gets to tell me who I am?</p><div style="margin-top:25px"><a class="btn primary" href="https://youtube.com/@bundieful" target="_blank">▶ Watch on YouTube</a></div></article>
<div class="featureSide">
<article class="mini reveal"><div class="num">Episode 02 / Youth & society</div><h3>The Abuse of Drugs</h3><p>An honest conversation about pressure, addiction, consequences, families, communities and the possibility of restoration.</p><a class="social" style="display:inline-block;padding:0;border:0;background:none" href="https://youtube.com/@bundieful" target="_blank">Watch on YouTube →</a></article>
<article class="mini reveal"><div class="num">Coming next</div><h3>More real conversations.</h3><p>Faith, purpose, culture, relationships and the questions young people are carrying.</p><a href="#connect" style="color:var(--gold2);font-weight:800">Follow Bundieful →</a></article>
</div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="story"><div class="wrap manifesto">
<div class="bigquote reveal">Your life is not random.<br><span>You are part of a story.</span></div>
<div class="copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">The heart of Bundieful</div><p>Bundieful is a space for honest conversations. We don't pretend young people have simple lives or that every question has an easy answer.</p><p>We bring real experiences into conversation with faith, Scripture, wisdom and hope — helping a generation think deeply about who they are and how they can live with purpose.</p>
<div class="values"><div class="value"><b>Identity</b><span>Know who you are.</span></div><div class="value"><b>Faith</b><span>Know what anchors you.</span></div><div class="value"><b>Impact</b><span>Live your story well.</span></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="dark" id="connect"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sectionHead reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">Join the community</div><h2>Stay connected.</h2></div><p>Follow Bundieful for new conversations, clips, reflections and updates.</p></div>
<div class="connectGrid">
<div class="social reveal"><strong>YouTube</strong><p>Full podcast conversations and video clips.</p><a href="https://youtube.com/@bundieful" target="_blank">Visit channel →</a></div>
<div class="social reveal"><strong>Instagram</strong><p>Reflections, short clips and behind the scenes.</p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/bundiefull" target="_blank">Follow @bundiefull →</a></div>
